        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3773"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This oversized greataxe, infamous for the chilling laughter it emits whenever it takes a life, was crafted by the frost giant sorcerer Jorngarl from the final blade named Toothy Morris after it was stolen in an attack on a Gray Gardener convoy. It functions as a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+3 major striking vorpal greataxe",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " that retains the unique properties of a Final Blade, trapping the souls of any it slays and preventing them from being returned to life by any means short of divine intervention, even a "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "0f1f01cd-bf9a-5147-bc44-1697e6548675"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " ritual or similar magic."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.mpu2fvjDVe771RbU"
    },
